{c: Verse 1}
[Am]Chehra Hai Ya [E]Chand Khila Hai
[Am]Zulf Ghaneri Shaam Hai Kya
[G]Saagar Jaisi Aankhon Vaali
[Am]Ye To Bataa Tera Naam Hai Kyaa
[Am]Tu Kya [E]Jaane Teri Khaatir
[Am]Kitna Hai Betaab Ye Dil
[Am]Tu Kya Jaane [E]Dekh Raha Hai
[F]Kaise Kaise [Am]Khwaab Ye Dil
[Am]Dil Kehta Hai Tu Hai Yahaan To
[Am]Jaata Lamha [E]Tham Jaaye
[A]Waqt Ka [D]Dariya Behte Behte
[G]Is Manzar [Am]Mein Jam Jaaye
[Am]Toone Deewana [E]Dil Ko Banaaya
[Am]Is Dil Par Ilzaam Hai Kya
[G]Saagar Jaisi Aankhon Vaali
[Am]Ye To Bataa Tera Naam Hai Kya...
[Am]Aaj Maein [E]Tujhse Door Sahi
[Am]Aur Tu Mujhse Anjaan Sahi
[Am]Tera Saath [E]Nahin Paaun To
[F]Khair Tera [Am]Armaan Sahi
[Am]Ye Armaan Hain Shor Nahin Ho
[Am]Khamoshi Ke [E]Mele Hon
[A]Is Duniya Mein [D]Koi Nahin Ho
[G]Hum Dono [Am]Hi Akele Hon
[Am]Tere Sapne [E]Dekh Raha Hoon
[Am]Aur Mera Ab Kaam Hai Kya
